Package: RNAmeta
Title: Genomic Region Annotation, Profiling and Visualization
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Rwtkc",
           email = "rwtkc@foxmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Rwtkc [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Rwtkc <rwtkc@foxmail.com>
Description: Provides annotation, statistical summaries and interactive
    visualizations for genomic interval data. The package supports shared peak
    annotation, gene-type and gene-matrix summaries, peak feature distributions,
    transcription, translation and splice-site profiles, and transcript meta
    plots. Static PNG and PDF export is available without an active display.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/Rwtkc/RNAmeta_R,
    https://rnainformatics.cn/RNAmeta-online/
BugReports: https://github.com/Rwtkc/RNAmeta_R/issues
SystemRequirements: librsvg2
Encoding: UTF-8
